{"4140080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Russian prison", "steam_appid": 4140080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the captivating world of a prison and try your hand at the difficult task of get out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this realistic game, you'll find yourself inside a closed world where danger lurks at every turn and your decisions can influence the course of events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main goal is to get out from prison. To do this, you'll have to overcome numerous challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you'll meet many unique characters. Each has their own story, prison alias, caste, reputation, and criminal record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of opportunities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in dialogue to influence relationships with prisoners and the plot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards for money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borrow money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contribute to the prison common fund</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic events:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working out in the gym</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Washing in the shower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conflicts with characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Fighting Tournament</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other events related to story progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy beautiful, dynamic fights with a rich arsenal of moves. Each fight is a unique experience: a variety of punches and kicks, realistic reactions to blows, and spectacular falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The course of the fight is influenced by luck and the characters' combat stats: health, energy, damage multiplier, and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Fighting Tournament:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victories can bring money and respect. But your chances of winning are slim. The tournament will feature experienced and strong fighters who are far superior to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of prison life, make difficult decisions, engage in dangerous conflicts, and fight for your freedom.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the captivating world of a prison and try your hand at the difficult task of get out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this realistic game, you'll find yourself inside a closed world where danger lurks at every turn and your decisions can influence the course of events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main goal is to get out from prison. To do this, you'll have to overcome numerous challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you'll meet many unique characters. Each has their own story, prison alias, caste, reputation, and criminal record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of opportunities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in dialogue to influence relationships with prisoners and the plot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards for money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borrow money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contribute to the prison common fund</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic events:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working out in the gym</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Washing in the shower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conflicts with characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Fighting Tournament</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other events related to story progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy beautiful, dynamic fights with a rich arsenal of moves. Each fight is a unique experience: a variety of punches and kicks, realistic reactions to blows, and spectacular falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The course of the fight is influenced by luck and the characters' combat stats: health, energy, damage multiplier, and speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Fighting Tournament:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victories can bring money and respect. But your chances of winning are slim. The tournament will feature experienced and strong fighters who are far superior to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of prison life, make difficult decisions, engage in dangerous conflicts, and fight for your freedom.</p>", "short_description": "An action and adventure game where you can explore a prison world, engage in dialogue with characters, play cards, and participate in a prison fighting tournament. The main goal is to get out from prison, which requires overcoming numerous challenges.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140080/d877248b48b356ba1c3ad8426b22e7fc4fbb26e5/header.jpg?t=1768502587", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140080/b57d1fb3f115217a5bdaa276b2468a5e612f6eb8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768502587", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140080/b57d1fb3f115217a5bdaa276b2468a5e612f6eb8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768502587", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class